{"id": "PB-FORAGE-001", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "A counter-prompt proves recoverability, not the disappearance of the failure.", "order": 1, "sha256": "ef7e0438bcbf1f907c6644e947a2d894748917477d80b770dcf6101ec4bc8b9b"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-002", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "A refusal cannot tell you whether the model can’t, won’t, or has been made not to.", "order": 2, "sha256": "3d36a3e2ec08bdba03a37458c519433809443a083c85a6de31fabe9ed54bcb26"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-003", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "The Prompt Battle may be measuring the operator-model pair rather than the model.", "order": 3, "sha256": "3d0023c8342c9fb86be6460c78f8887e7f04caff7e35abfe2ed56af4f5d0e3f7"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-004", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "Once the critique pool adapts to the battle, the benchmark becomes an endogenous curriculum.", "order": 4, "sha256": "1d87d9d5269b42e6bb4d2d297e1c152b749f9778d4f9f664666fb85e7268edf7"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-005", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "The scientific part of a Prompt Battle may have to happen before the fighting begins.", "order": 5, "sha256": "c4f204f4c572f3706caa20390212995dd1e8e55132fbcc0201b9482e20477aea"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-006", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "Judge disagreement may be data, not a defect in the scoring system.", "order": 6, "sha256": "cc46016be808dc9270006b996c77e060a1c3e307d3258664fb568210c8fb626c"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-007", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "The outside of the Prompt Battle keeps leaking into the experiment.", "order": 7, "sha256": "970af9015ba64f813351e13aad02b5921e2650d93409f00f248f8f50c757b874"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-008", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "A cypher is not a circular user interface.", "order": 8, "sha256": "5b2cd137ee1762d5599948326adacbf1a292d533326ce1e3c6a94318db3d0adb"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-009", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "A prompt can be an epistemic action rather than an instruction.", "order": 9, "sha256": "35fca9c5da8470dc5f8d0f0cc094e4a1847a757e45af3b4b3394bd87ad4fedaa"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-010", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "Coupling is not enough; the coupling may have to be reliable before capability changes owners.", "order": 10, "sha256": "0a873f61891c919f4015344292fdbd379dc40e0b18ac8593222890451d72f6da"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-011", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "An adaptive benchmark can become part of the causal system it claims merely to observe.", "order": 11, "sha256": "9477c7cf4a971302566b76bfba2b51f56587cb76947ec98ef09dcadbb5a59a0e"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-012", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "Disagreement is not evidence until its mechanism is identified.", "order": 12, "sha256": "e26fe1ecdb202ff9c4c86294202f1a3e6c1b2ae8726eefb2a780aaa07222b72b"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-013", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "The clearer the scoring rule becomes, the more precisely contestants can optimize the wrong thing.", "order": 13, "sha256": "0c0c3b2cb1fcd0ac1e1da03e75f7338bb81b574859ef224231fd86a198ecd23a"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-014", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "Turning the cypher into portable mechanics may reproduce the erasure that the cypher literature is trying to repair.", "order": 14, "sha256": "925d42bc860beef026256b53583fa617ea21307a48dfd85e3ecc716a60b7b7d4"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-015", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "A shared experiment can settle the result while leaving the disagreement alive.", "order": 15, "sha256": "edeb153ee8c41a23078d864353f02ab6bc47c50532b9046f8984379e3ea951bb"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-016", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "The function of the battle may not be to win.", "order": 16, "sha256": "cf8cae283a23b5b0c7f243d32ee7defd2e97b32b1f35535db5bfa91f6cb38ab9"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-017", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "A rigged Prompt Battle may be more honest than a supposedly neutral one.", "order": 17, "sha256": "8688dd7a5cf533838ab9406dc30bc68ae70e6d91cc4406ceb2f2363c2a9a75e3"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-018", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "A model failure may need to be held in place before it can become evidence.", "order": 18, "sha256": "b2f7e7921e210a556398ae67fc88a61810403019f99faf0ce3d2b8613f4b3f2f"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-019", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "If capability is distributed, the Prompt Battle has lost the wrestler’s body.", "order": 19, "sha256": "332a356d5d76c7d0a682b80a4d8cadd685d601d2da99236c7143f3b456ba30af"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-020", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "Fairness can become kayfabe before anyone cheats.", "order": 20, "sha256": "744aa79f666f6765e23f47890b5cf2c29d10cc022080e5e329883988d58f20fe"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-021", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "The crowd may be scoring justice while the researchers think it is scoring capability.", "order": 21, "sha256": "6c8a5fe98e72cbdfc1015d4b7bd7c0d1afe5c053e5cf97285ec809e4df466daf"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-022", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "The WWE version of the paper needs absolutes, but the research cannot afford to believe them.", "order": 22, "sha256": "2707d1eca0d435b09dfa456e1269d544e0261ffecd245bac07f029fb07fc588c"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-023", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "The paper needs a heel strong enough to beat the thesis.", "order": 23, "sha256": "00e353117ff66bcd04e7dac6bae8d2b9065da07727cafe80edc2318e1457dff7"}
{"id": "PB-FORAGE-024", "type": "ZETTEL", "title": "The real finishing move is the reversal that changes what the fight was about.", "order": 24, "sha256": "16eb953e56db9854f6d235c5bc00276fb500a7f7977ff4bd46420839ae7b18f7"}
